# screenshots
# Public-safe demo screenshots are allowed only in screenshots/.
# Review screenshots outside screenshots/ before public release.
# Never commit screenshots containing secrets, private chats, real accounts,
# tokens, API keys, emails, personal data, or production infrastructure.

